      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the words “under section 12” the words “or a digital platform service provider registered under section 20d”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the words “that operator” wherever appearing the words “or digital platform service provider”. Amendment of section 70"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Tourism Tax (Amendment) Act 2020."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different Parts or different provisions of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding subsection (2), the Minister may, by notification in the Gazette, appoint the effective date for the charging and levying of tourism tax on accommodation premises made available through service relating to online booking accommodation premises under this Act. New section 1a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Tourism Tax Act 2017 [Act 791], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended by inserting after section 1 the following section: “Territorial and extra-territorial application 1a. (1) This Act and its subsidiary legislation shall apply both within and outside Malaysia. (2) Notwithstanding subsection (1), this Act and its subsidiary legislation shall apply to any person of whatever nationality or citizenship, beyond the geographical limits of Malaysia and the territorial waters of Malaysia, if the person is a digital platform service provider registered under section 20d.”. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 70(2) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (d), by deleting the word “and” at the end of the paragraph;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (e), by substituting for the full stop at the end of the paragraph the word “; and”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (e) the following paragraph: “(f) to prescribe matters relating to digital platform service provider.”. Online booking of accommodation premises before effective date"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any booking of accommodation premises is made by a tourist with a digital platform service provider through the service relating to online booking accommodation premises before the effective date mentioned in subsection 1(3) and the tourist stays at such accommodation premises on or after the effective date, no tourism tax shall be charged on the tourist."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 2 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “operator” the following definition: ‘ “digital platform service provider” means any person who provides service relating to online booking accommodation premises to a tourist whether such person is in Malaysia or outside Malaysia;’; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “accommodation premises” the following definition: ‘ “service relating to online booking accommodation premises” means any online service relating to the booking of accommodation premises that is delivered automatically over the internet or any other electronic network;’. Amendment of section 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 9(1) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (b), by substituting for the words “or class of operator” the words “, class of operator, digital platform service provider or class of digital platform service provider”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (c)— Amendment of section 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “or class of operator” the words “, class of operator, digital platform service provider or class of digital platform service provider”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_4__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the words “Part IV” the words “or Part Va”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 13 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) Where there is no notification made under subsection (1) and the Director General is satisfied that the operator has ceased to operate an accommodation premises or is exempted under section 9, the Director General may cancel the operator’s registration from the date the operator ceased to operate the accommodation premises or from the date the operator is exempted or from such later date as the Director General may determine, as the case may be.”. Amendment of section 14"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 14(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “operator shall” the words “, within thirty days from the date the accommodation is provided or such extended period as may be approved by the Director General,”. Amendment of section 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 15 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the word “operator” the words “or a digital platform service provider”. Amendment of section 18"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 18 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsections: “(3) Notwithstanding subsection (1), an operator may apply in writing to the Director General for another taxable period. (4) The Director General may, upon receiving any application under subsection (3)— (a) allow the application and the taxable period shall be the period as applied for; (b) refuse the application and the taxable period shall remain as determined under subsection (1); or (c) vary the length of the taxable period or the date on which the taxable period begins or ends. (5) Notwithstanding subsection (1) or (4), the Director General may, as he deems fit, reassign any other taxable period for the operator.”. Amendment of section 20"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_9__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_9__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 20 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/25/eng@/~cl_9__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
